        <content>{!$EinsteinSearch:File_Income_Tax_1Cx_rdd8bf4c5bb.results}
Primary Query Focus:
 Respond to the customer&apos;s query regarding international transactions or TDS under Section 195: {!$Input:Input_text}
Data Sources:
Customer Profile &amp; Residency Status: {!$RecordSnapshot:Account.Snapshot}
Past Withholding Payments or Filings:{!$RelatedList:Account.Filings__r.Records}{!$EinsteinSearch:File_Income_Tax_1Cx_rdd8bf4c5bb.results}
Steps:
Identify nature of cross-border transaction (royalty, technical service, dividend, import of services)
Determine applicable withholding tax rates and DTAA impact
Refer to Section 195, Rule 37BB (Form 15CA/15CB), or relevant DTAA clauses
Flag whether remittance requires CA certificate or TDS return
Advise on PAN/Aadhaar/PE requirements (if applicable)
Clarify FEMA and RBI regulations tied to the transaction
Provide a compliance checklist and procedural steps for remittance

</content>
